      "id": "mqtt_pub_text",
      "x": 205,
      "y": 1020,
      "width": 459.375,
      "height": 201.6,
      "text": "Gateway → Server  (publish)\n\ngw/{id}/telemetry          (10초 주기)\ngw/{id}/state              (online/offline · LWT)\ngw/{id}/heartbeat          (30초 주기)\ngw/{id}/event              (알람/에러)\ngw/{id}/config/reported    (적용 결과)\ngw/{id}/command/response   (실행 결과)\ngw/{id}/ota/status",
      "originalText": "Gateway → Server  (publish)\n\ngw/{id}/telemetry          (10초 주기)\ngw/{id}/state              (online/offline · LWT)\ngw/{id}/heartbeat          (30초 주기)\ngw/{id}/event              (알람/에러)\ngw/{id}/config/reported    (적용 결과)\ngw/{id}/command/response   (실행 결과)\ngw/{id}/ota/status",
